  "details": "There are three issues:\n\n(1) The functions for key R1 & R2 are reverced. R1 is the Gesture Wheel key, and R2 is the the Grab/Interact key.\n\n(2) The two secondary keys both have reduced functionaliry: They both are only used outside of menuing, and are both disabled when menuing. I.e., they cannot interact with (select/exit) the menu. Thus, I would suggest the functions written are inaccurate.\n\n(3) L1, L2, R1, & R2 are Sony controller nomenclature, while the controller displayed is an XBox controller. LB, LT, RB, & RT would be more accurate for the current illustration.",
